# The kill flash, drawn where a drone died. 32x32.
#
# Bigger than the drone it replaces, which is the point — an explosion the same
# size as the thing that exploded reads as a swap, not as a death. Scaled down
# over its short life so the first frame is the largest.
name shooter-burst
size 32 32
key o outline
key W rust-3
key A rust-4-hilite
pixels
